618d5c22 (1103 1792384201596 "guenchi" (("w5vbequy" . 14982)) (put ((kind . section) (title . "landing f308b") (src . "test: the declaration replay row counts lookups instead of timing them\n\nA seam in the reducer, a parameter a fixture binds in process and the product never binds,\ncounts the lookups a replay makes in the declaration tables; the replay row asserts one\nlookup per declaration record, exactly, at two sizes, where the association lists made\nhalf the square of the count; a second row delivers the same records from a writer sorted\nfirst, every record waiting in the pending queue, and reads the same count, so the count\nis independent of the delivery order whose cost the timings showed. The timings stay as a\nnote. The limit of the instrument is stated: it counts what the code reports about itself.\n") (parent . root) (ord . 422))))
