a687c4bf (1110 1792397829766 "import-git" (("w5vbequy" . 14982)) (put ((kind . decision) (slot . "import") (from . "c36daee66058fecac3c9e345386c4ae63589a7c1") (to . "12139f761563370f8e99dd322319c7232954a5dc") (tag . "import-12139f7") (status . "pending") (src . "query: a session advanced to a later state, its positive strata maintained by delete-and-rederive\nquery: the auxiliary session's work bounded by the advance's remaining budget and charged on refusal too\nquery fixture: every carried key inspected, deletions and the auxiliary refusal charged, a library renamed, forwardness through advance\nquery fixture: every carried key of the two-strata row, insertions and the auxiliary derivation charged, S's builds kept, a two-name component, each external, edge-kind, another actor\nquery fixture: concurrent writers named to sort after the local one, exact charges, S's memo, a partial table, every key of the two-name component, forwardness through advance and by dependencies\nquery fixture: the empty carried key and the re-derivation's charge, S's expansion counts, a cached version in the new session, whole refusals, a loud writer-name collision\nquery fixture: a demanded key of the stratum, evaluated while a held key it reads is short, joins the maintained set\nquery fixture: a batch answers batch, the edge-kind row under a name not reserved; the census pins the advance's two handlers\nrows baseline: session-advance\nquery fixture: the opening comment says which rows compare with the oracle\n") (parent . root) (ord . 423))))
